<title>ESTONIA: LEKS INSURANCE SELLS BORDER TRAFFIC INSURANCE.</title>
<headline>LEKS INSURANCE SELLS BORDER TRAFFIC INSURANCE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leks insurance began selling automobile border insurance from June 27 to cover owners of foreign registered vehicles or their users for traffic accidents while on Estonian roads, the insurance company said on Tuesday. </p>
<p>In a statement the compnay said that the policy is aimed to cover those travellers who do not have an internationally recognised green traffic insurance card or for vehicles in transit and without compulsory traffic insurance.</p>
<p>The state traffic insurance fund will back the insurance policy.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
